  <!-- Totems -->
  <!--原中文: '图腾', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Totems',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Totems-->
  <TM_Totems.label>图腾</TM_Totems.label>
  <!--原中文: '图腾是一种魔法种类，它将元素灵魂锚定在物质世界上，并允许它影响图腾附近的物体。这个技能增加了对所有类型图腾的控制。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Totems are a form of magic that anchors an elemental spirit to the physical world allowing it to influence objects near the totem. This ability increases control over all types of totems.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Totems are a form of magic that anchors an elemental spirit to the physical world allowing it to influence objects near the totem. This ability increases control over all types of totems.-->
  <TM_Totems.description>图腾是一种魔法种类，它将元素灵魂锚定在物质世界上，并允许它影响图腾附近的物体。这个技能增加了对所有类型图腾的控制。</TM_Totems.description>
  <!-- Create lightning totem -->
  <!--原中文: '图腾：闪电', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Totem: Lightning',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Totem: Lightning-->
  <TM_SummonTotemLightning.label>图腾：闪电</TM_SummonTotemLightning.label>
  <!--原中文: '在目标位置制造一个闪电图腾。持续1个游戏小时，每2-3秒在40米范围内对敌人施放闪电攻击。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Creates a lightning totem at the target location. Lasts 1 game hr and discharges electrical bolts at enemies within 40m every 2-3 seconds.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Creates a lightning totem at the target location. Lasts 1 game hr and discharges electrical bolts at enemies within 40m every 2-3 seconds.-->
  <TM_SummonTotemLightning.description>在目标位置制造一个闪电图腾。持续1个游戏小时，每2-3秒在40米范围内对敌人施放闪电攻击。</TM_SummonTotemLightning.description>
