  <!-- Enrage -->
  <!--原中文: '激怒', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Enrage',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Enrage-->
  <TM_Enrage.label>激怒</TM_Enrage.label>
  <!--原中文: '释放魔法诅咒生物，使他们的情绪（坏脾气）成为战斗怒气的燃料。一旦所有的情感都被消耗掉了，激怒魔法就会自我焚毁。如果是敌方目标的思想受到攻击，他们会立即变得狂暴。\n一个愤怒的人会获得移动和操作加成，增加疼痛抵抗力，不会眩晕，并且百分之X增加近战伤害,X等于愤怒的严重程度（20-50%的伤害加成）。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Places a hex on a target that causes their emotions (Mood) to become fuel for battle rage. The hex will burn itself out once all emotions have been consumed. Hostile targets will immediately become berserk if their mind is susceptible.

An enraged pawn gains increased movement and manipulation, increased pain resistance, cannot be staggered, and increases melee damage by the percent equal to the severity of enrage (20-50% damage bonus).',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Places a hex on a target that causes their emotions (Mood) to become fuel for battle rage. The hex will burn itself out once all emotions have been consumed. Hostile targets will immediately become berserk if their mind is susceptible.

An enraged pawn gains increased movement and manipulation, increased pain resistance, cannot be staggered, and increases melee damage by the percent equal to the severity of enrage (20-50% damage bonus).-->
  <TM_Enrage.description>释放魔法诅咒生物，使他们的情绪（坏脾气）成为战斗怒气的燃料。一旦所有的情感都被消耗掉了，激怒魔法就会自我焚毁。如果是敌方目标的思想受到攻击，他们会立即变得狂暴。\n一个愤怒的人会获得移动和操作加成，增加疼痛抵抗力，不会眩晕，并且百分之X增加近战伤害,X等于愤怒的严重程度（20-50%的伤害加成）。</TM_Enrage.description>
